#: inc/admin/migrations/migration-4.2.5.php:25
msgid ""
"Update the shipping phone field visibility option from the legacy value to "
"match WooCommerce conventions."
msgstr ""
"Opdater synlighedsindstillingen for feltet »Forsendelsestelefonnummer« fra "
"den gamle værdi, så den stemmer overens med WooCommerce-konventionerne."

