"indstilling for baggrundsfarven i den sekundære kolonne i »Split«-designet."

#: inc/compat/plugins/compat-plugin-biteship.php:61
msgid ""
"The enhanced select fields feature is always disabled when using the "
"Biteship plugin."
msgstr ""
"Funktionen »Udvidet valg af felter« er altid deaktiveret, når man bruger "
"Biteship-pluginet."

#: inc/compat/plugins/compat-plugin-woocommerce-german-market.php:112
msgid ""
"The place order position is always set to \"Below the order summary\" when "
"using German Market. That plugin requires the place order button and legal "
"checkboxes to be displayed below the order summary."
msgstr ""
"Placeringen af ordreafgivelsesknappen er altid indstillet til »Under "
"ordreoversigten«, når man bruger German Market. Dette plugin kræver, at "
"ordreafgivelsesknappen og de lovmæssige afkrydsningsfelter vises under "
"ordreoversigten."

#: inc/compat/plugins/compat-plugin-woocommerce-germanized.php:243
msgid ""
"The place order position is always set to \"Below the order summary\" when "
"using Germanized for WooCommerce. That plugin requires the place order "
"button and legal checkboxes to be displayed below the order summary."
msgstr ""
"Placeringen af bestillingsknappen er altid indstillet til »Under "
"ordresammendraget«, når man bruger Germanized til WooCommerce. Dette plugin "
"kræver, at bestillingsknappen og de juridiske afkrydsningsfelter vises "
"under ordresammendraget."

